# PriceWise AI

An AI-powered price comparison web application that helps users find the best price for a product and discover cheaper alternatives, built as our semester project for Software Construction and Development.

## Problem

Online shoppers often don't know if they're getting the best price, since prices vary across retailers and change frequently. PriceWise AI solves this by searching multiple stores at once, highlighting the lowest price, and suggesting similar cheaper alternatives.

