## Tech Stack

- **Frontend:** Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS
- **Backend:** Node.js, Express.js, TypeScript
- **Database:** PostgreSQL (via Prisma ORM)
- **External API:** SerpAPI (Google Shopping data)
- **Auth:** JWT (email/password) and Google OAuth

## Features

- Product search with multi-store price comparison
- AI-powered cheaper alternative suggestions
- Price history tracking
- Wishlist and price-drop alerts with email notifications
- User dashboard (wishlist, alerts, search history)